---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Microsoft
BreakAfterAttributes: Always
---
# Objective-C follows the prevailing convention for the language (two-space indent, attached
# braces) rather than the Allman style used for C++, which is what apple_api_wrapper.m was
# already written in. The column limit matches the C++ section. Function bodies are not folded
# onto the signature line, which a 120-column limit would otherwise do to several of them.
Language: ObjC
BasedOnStyle: Google
ColumnLimit: 120
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Empty
...
